  "title": "Methanex Corporation - Notice of Cash Dividend - Methanex",
  "summary": "VANCOUVER, British Columbia, April 29, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Methanex Corporation (the “Company” or “Methanex”) (TSX:MX) (Nasdaq:MEOH) announced today that its Board of Directors has declared a quarterly dividend of US$0.185 per share. The dividend will be payable on June 30, 2026, to holders of common shares of record on June 16, 2026. Methanex is […]",
